   119	# can downgrade ONE (doc, metric, EXACT-frozen-value) triple from violation to
   120	# a printed PENDING line. The mechanism exists for mid-session freezes of
   650	        r'(\d+) ligados\b',   # pt: "**46 ligados**" (README.pt-BR.md)
