  1210	
  1211	    A delete/re-tag recovery leaves the original run re-approvable with
  1212	    checkout pinned to the old event SHA; nothing before `npm publish`
  1213	    re-resolved the remote tag, so an obsolete run could irreversibly
  1214	    publish the wrong tree. These pins keep the fail-closed liveness
  1215	    assert present, correctly shaped, and ORDERED immediately before the
  1216	    publish step.
  1217	    """
  1218	
