    94	| Manual approval | `environment: production-npm` (configured in Settings → Environments with required reviewers) | `v*` GA tags run the job but pause for human approval before `npm publish` |
    95	
    96	Operator flow when a real GA tag is pushed:
    97	1. Tag landed, workflow queues `publish` job.
    98	2. GitHub Environments blocks the job pending Owner review.
    99	3. Owner reviews VERSION + npm/package.json + CHANGELOG one last time.
   100	4. Owner approves → job resumes and runs `npm publish --provenance`.
   101	5. Owner rejects → job cancels; no publish happens.
